// Verb semantics (2026-08-10): a *degenerate* range (`>= 2 and <= 2`) fixes
// the count, so `deal` proceeds automatically without prompting.
player P1
turnorder (P:P1)
location Hand on all
location Deck on table

card on Deck:
  Rank(Ace, Two, Three, Four, Five) for Suit(Hearts)

stage Play for current 1 times {
  deal >= 2 and <= 2 from Deck private to Hand of P:P1
  end stage
}
